#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:11
msgid ""
"Your WooCommerce store is successfully connected to Reviewbird. Review data "
"is syncing properly."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce-kauppasi on onnistuneesti yhdistetty Reviewbirdiin. "
"Arvostelutiedot synkronoituvat oikein."

